+
+- **Grok:** 1 **CONFIRMED**; 2 **CONFIRMED**; 3 **CONFIRMED**; 4 **CONFIRMED** except its circularity rationale; 5 **CONFIRMED**; 6 **CONFIRMED**; 7 **CONFIRMED**; 8 **CONFIRMED** except its strongest claim about the sequel; 9 **CONFIRMED**; 10 **CONFIRMED** item by item above; 11 **CONFIRMED**; 12 **CONFIRMED** on the unsupported “usually” claim and **UNVERIFIABLE** as an audience prediction; 13 **CONFIRMED**; 14 **CONFIRMED** as a diagnosis, proposed replacement grades **UNVERIFIABLE**.
+- **Agy:** 1 **CONFIRMED**; 2 **CONFIRMED**; 3 **REJECTED**; 4 **CONFIRMED**, but its proposed wording **REJECTED**; 5 **UNVERIFIABLE** as an audience prediction, with its factual premises confirmed elsewhere.
